# Worf, Still Not Merry: "Whenever Worf attacks, for each attacking non-Faerie creature, create a tapped and attacking 1/1 blue
# Faerie creature token with flying." Worf and Llanowar Elves attack, so two creatures count - Worf himself among them - and two
# Faeries are made together, tapped and attacking Bot2 (CR 603.4, 508.2, 508.4). All four attack for 5 + 1 + 1 + 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Worf, Still Not Merry
Llanowar Elves
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

